# cetirizine.msf
# Cetirizine  pKa1=2.200 (COOH→COO-, q=+1→0), pKa2=8.000 (piperazinium→N, q=0→-1)
# Source: Avdeef 2001 / Manallack 2007
# Second-gen antihistamine (H1-blocker). Zwitterionic at physiological pH:
# piperazine N+ and carboxylate O- coexist at pH 5-7. This dual ionisation
# governs its low CNS penetration (zwitterion crosses BBB poorly) vs loratadine
# (neutral) which is more sedating. Tests mutual electronic influence of COOH
# and piperazinium across 4 bonds.

